   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Obligation and permission",
     "texto": [
      "**Skal** = to have to: **Du skal hvile dig.** = You have to rest.",
      "**Må gerne** = you may (with permission): **Du må gerne bruge den.** = You may use it. With **må ikke** = you mustn't: **Du må ikke bruge den.** = You mustn't use it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Deduction and advice",
     "texto": [
      "**Må** also means «must (probably)»: **Han må være træt.** = He must be tired.",
      "**Bør** = should: **Du bør hvile dig lidt før festen.** = You should rest a little before the party.",
      "**Skal være** can also be what others say: **Hun skal være rig.** = They say she's rich."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
